<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, wholesale sales.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, wholesale sales.</headline>
<text>
<p>WIESBADEN, Germany, March 27 (Reuter) The following economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	  PERIOD	  PREVIOUS	    EXPECTED</p>
<p>						 DATA		  DATE</p>
<p>  Trade balance	Jan	    +7.2 bln DM	  Apr 2-3</p>
<p>  Wholesale sales    Feb     +2.5 pct m/m, +2.7 y/y  Apr 4 or 7</p>
<p>NOTE - the Federal Statistics office siad the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 260 97 150</p>
</text>
